Z||000000||86seyellow||09-22-2001||09:58 AM||||well.<P>Just a quick note. I got the car back. New 2.8 with 0 miles. put in new dist,starter,alternator,hoses,fuel rail, clutch, flywheel and fuel injectors. ALl I can say is wow. I barely touch the pedal and she is flying. After all said and done with everythign it cost me $2500. I feel very good about the price and the work. After the shop got done they asked me if I would sell it. I simply replied no. The mechanic offered a 1970 camaro with a 400 non stock with all chrome show car even up. I walked away feeling very good about this.<P><P>------------------<BR>if you saw a yellow streak go by you really fast it was a fiero<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieropix1.JPG"> ||||reg||6
